##

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:03.278 line:91%
It's a rainy day in London.
We haven't playtested this at all.

00:00:03.278 --> 00:00:06.460 position:58% line:91%
I have no idea if this is gonna work,
but this is Arun from Mrwhosetheboss.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.108 line:91%
<c.yellow>Hello.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>And you have an AirTag.</c>

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:11.485 line:91%
<c.yellow>I do. So this is basically
a low-power Bluetooth tracker,</c>

00:00:11.485 --> 00:00:14.945 position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>and I'm gonna stick it in Tom's pocket
and see if I can find you.</c>

00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:18.001 line:91%
<i>The producers have put together
a list of things to do in London.</i>

00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:21.667 position:67% line:91%
<i>I've got one hour from when I see that list
to do as much of it as I can.</i>

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:24.633 line:91%
<i>And all Arun has to do
is catch me.</i>

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:25.972 line:85%
How confident are you?

00:00:25.972 --> 00:00:29.018 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>I feel great, 'cause I just realised
Tom has an iPhone,</c>

00:00:29.018 --> 00:00:32.011 line:91%
<c.yellow>and these things get their location
by pinging off iPhones.</c>

00:00:32.011 --> 00:00:34.722 line:91%
So every time I open this up
for Google Maps...

00:00:34.722 --> 00:00:35.837 line:85%
<c.yellow>I'm gonna know where you are.</c>

00:00:35.837 --> 00:00:38.500 line:91%
Every time I walk past someone
with any Apple device...

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.550 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.442 line:85%
Alright, it's in the pocket.

00:00:41.442 --> 00:00:44.067 position:61% line:91%
One hour on the clock,
and I've got a three-minute head start.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.582 line:91%
This is now—
Are you stretching?!

00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:52.750 line:91%
This is gonna look
rough and ready because...

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:56.675 line:91%
all we have on cameras here are
one GoPro for each of us following.

00:00:56.675 --> 00:00:59.717 position:61% line:91%
So... if you wanna get the timer ready.
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:02.937 line:91%
One hour.
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:06.001 line:91%
Three, two, one, go.
<c.yellow>Two, one, tap.</c>

00:01:07.052 --> 00:01:08.646 line:91%
<c.cyan>Guh!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Aaaah!</c>

00:01:08.646 --> 00:01:10.762 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>Ohh, I'm so scared.
Okay, so we gotta give him three minutes.</c>

00:01:10.762 --> 00:01:12.317 line:85%
<c.yellow>He's a fast runner.</c>

00:01:12.317 --> 00:01:15.560 position:58% line:91%
Right, so I've only got three minutes
before he's on the move.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.600 line:85%
So, first step is go underground...

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.922 line:91%
where this isn't gonna work
right away.

00:01:20.922 --> 00:01:22.245 line:91%
<c.yellow>As soon as
he turns his phone off,</c>

00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:24.001 line:91%
<c.yellow>we're gonna struggle
to track him as accurately.</c>

00:01:24.814 --> 00:01:26.395 line:85%
<c.yellow>It's not updating.</c>

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:28.008 line:85%
<c.yellow>Tom!</c>

00:01:28.008 --> 00:01:30.503 line:91%
"Dance to a busker.
Take a selfie with Sherlock."

00:01:30.503 --> 00:01:32.564 line:91%
Oh blimey,
there's so many things here!

00:01:32.564 --> 00:01:34.526 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>This is a lot of challenges, though!</c>

00:01:34.526 --> 00:01:37.825 line:91%
Closest one is— right—
"feed the ducks at a Royal Park."

00:01:37.825 --> 00:01:40.347 position:59% line:91%
I'm gonna need something—
"Salute a guard at Buckingham Palace."

00:01:40.347 --> 00:01:42.251 line:91%
We're going to Buckingham Palace.
That's happening.

00:01:42.251 --> 00:01:45.017 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay so, I'm gonna check the list
to see where he's going.</c>

00:01:45.017 --> 00:01:46.567 line:85%
Green Park. I need Green Park.

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:48.202 line:91%
<c.yellow>Three minutes feels like
such a long time!</c>

00:01:53.349 --> 00:01:55.525 line:85%
<c.yellow>This requires London geography.</c>

00:01:55.525 --> 00:01:59.773 line:91%
He's had several minutes to think,
whereas I just panicked and ran,

00:01:59.773 --> 00:02:01.459 line:85%
and I think...

00:02:01.459 --> 00:02:03.151 line:85%
that might've been a bad idea.

00:02:03.151 --> 00:02:05.497 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm gonna have to Google
a lot of these things.</c>

00:02:05.497 --> 00:02:08.034 line:91%
The good news is,
as soon as I'm on this train,

00:02:08.034 --> 00:02:11.109 position:61% line:91%
he's not gonna get this train,
and he's not gonna be able to track me.

00:02:11.109 --> 00:02:13.247 position:61% line:85%
But... he'll know that I'm on the Tube.

00:02:13.247 --> 00:02:14.848 line:91%
<c.yellow>He's in the station.
He's in the station!</c>

00:02:14.848 --> 00:02:17.502 line:85%
Okay... but where's he going?

00:02:17.502 --> 00:02:19.689 line:91%
<c.yellow>Oh, we should probably
get started, alright.</c>

00:02:20.602 --> 00:02:21.792 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(giggles)</i></c>

00:02:21.792 --> 00:02:23.775 line:91%
<c.yellow>Could you imagine if
we got on the same train as him?</c>

00:02:24.761 --> 00:02:26.661 line:85%
<c.yellow>This is some much-needed cardio.</c>

00:02:26.661 --> 00:02:30.140 line:91%
The Tube is so fast, and yet
feels so slow right now.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:32.600 line:85%
This is incredibly frustrating.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.770 line:91%
<c.yellow>On the bright side though,
it's part of this game</c>

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:37.643 line:91%
<c.yellow>that Tom can only use each form
of public transport once.</c>

00:02:37.643 --> 00:02:41.512 line:91%
I don't think it's gonna be, like,
that accurate tracking.

00:02:41.512 --> 00:02:42.689 line:85%
<c.yellow>I trust these AirTags.</c>

00:02:43.189 --> 00:02:44.884 line:85%
Whoops. Sorry. Excuse me.

00:02:44.884 --> 00:02:46.790 line:91%
<c.yellow>So the reason I picked
Covent Garden is I think,</c>

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.230 line:91%
<c.yellow>quite a few things on this list
he could do there.</c>

00:02:50.189 --> 00:02:52.105 line:85%
<c.yellow>It feels like candidate number one.</c>

00:02:53.812 --> 00:02:56.141 line:85%
<c.yellow>"Feed the ducks. Mimic a statue."</c>

00:02:56.141 --> 00:02:58.057 line:91%
<c.yellow>There will be a statue
in Covent Garden.</c>

00:02:59.106 --> 00:03:00.301 line:85%
<c.yellow>Not my stop, is it?</c>

00:03:00.301 --> 00:03:02.951 line:91%
Okay, easy first point:
imitate a statue.

00:03:04.164 --> 00:03:06.122 line:91%
This is where London knowledge
comes in handy!

00:03:06.769 --> 00:03:08.807 line:91%
<c.yellow>Two more stops.
Might as well get a seat.</c>

00:03:08.807 --> 00:03:11.479 line:91%
What've we got?
We got... facing this way...

00:03:11.479 --> 00:03:12.899 line:85%
<c.yellow>Gonna be using these.</c>

00:03:12.899 --> 00:03:14.332 line:85%
Turn that way.

00:03:14.332 --> 00:03:17.003 line:91%
That, it turns out,
is a very, very difficult position.

00:03:17.003 --> 00:03:18.948 line:91%
Do you think that's close enough?
Do I get the point?

00:03:18.948 --> 00:03:20.130 line:85%
<c.cyan>This hand, this way.</c>

00:03:21.322 --> 00:03:23.215 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Good enough. That's one.</c>

00:03:23.215 --> 00:03:24.277 line:85%
This way.

00:03:24.277 --> 00:03:25.892 line:85%
<c.yellow>He could go on the bus, but...</c>

00:03:25.892 --> 00:03:28.445 line:91%
<c.yellow>you're almost faster
walking in London.</c>

00:03:28.445 --> 00:03:31.057 line:91%
<c.yellow>He could take a bike.
He's a bit of a rogue character.</c>

00:03:31.057 --> 00:03:32.693 line:85%
<c.yellow>Tom Scott can do anything(!)</c>

00:03:33.565 --> 00:03:35.336 line:85%
I did not realise...

00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:38.358 line:91%
quite how paranoid I'd be,
how quickly.

00:03:38.358 --> 00:03:40.377 line:85%
Because... this is...

00:03:40.377 --> 00:03:43.344 line:91%
I know, like, worst case,
absolute worst case,

00:03:43.344 --> 00:03:45.053 line:85%
he's one train behind me.

00:03:45.053 --> 00:03:49.139 line:91%
But this is...
a very big, open space.

00:03:50.226 --> 00:03:52.521 line:85%
And I am now very trackable.

00:03:52.521 --> 00:03:54.602 line:91%
<c.yellow>Alright, Tom Scott.
I'm coming for you.</c>

00:03:55.649 --> 00:03:57.736 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>Or maybe we're on the
other side of London. We'll find out.</c>

00:03:57.736 --> 00:04:00.441 line:85%
Agh. Have I got time...?

00:04:01.215 --> 00:04:02.484 line:85%
<c.yellow>"To the stairs."</c>

00:04:03.751 --> 00:04:04.879 line:91%
I don't have time.
I don't have time.

00:04:04.879 --> 00:04:06.606 line:85%
<c.yellow>Is this an exit? I don't know!</c>

00:04:06.606 --> 00:04:08.143 line:85%
Alright.

00:04:08.143 --> 00:04:10.004 line:85%
<c.yellow>What is this? <i>(groans)</i></c>

00:04:10.004 --> 00:04:11.620 line:85%
Buckingham Palace.

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:13.532 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(breathless)</i> The pain, the pain!</c>

00:04:13.532 --> 00:04:15.717 line:85%
<c.yellow>Tom! What've you done to me, Tom?</c>

00:04:15.717 --> 00:04:17.120 line:85%
Guard. Guard.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.101 line:85%
Me, guard.

00:04:19.623 --> 00:04:20.727 line:85%
Two.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:21.833 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(panting heavily)</i></c>

00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:23.625 line:85%
<c.yellow>Now I realise I shoulda...</c>

00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:25.368 line:85%
<c.yellow>I shoulda taken the lift.</c>

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:28.979 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(wheezes exhaustedly)</i></c>

00:04:28.979 --> 00:04:30.853 line:85%
I don't suppose you have any...

00:04:30.853 --> 00:04:32.420 line:91%
Don't suppose you got
any snacks on you

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.408 line:91%
for duck feeding or
anything like that, have you?

00:04:34.408 --> 00:04:35.353 line:85%
'Cause...

00:04:36.889 --> 00:04:38.107 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:04:38.107 --> 00:04:40.545 line:91%
Is it okay to feed
a Milky Way bar to ducks?

00:04:42.026 --> 00:04:44.714 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay. So we're in Covent Garden now.</c>

00:04:44.714 --> 00:04:47.680 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>But let's check the AirTag location.
Hopefully he is here.</c>

00:04:49.847 --> 00:04:52.459 line:85%
Hey Siri, can ducks eat chocolate?

00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:54.914 line:91%
<c.yellow>So the AirTag is still putting
his location as the Underground,</c>

00:04:54.914 --> 00:04:56.612 line:85%
<c.yellow>which means...</c>

00:04:56.612 --> 00:04:58.578 line:91%
<c.yellow>he might not have got
out of the train yet.</c>

00:04:58.578 --> 00:05:01.356 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>Got an answer.
It's displayed on your iPhone.</i></c>

00:05:01.356 --> 00:05:04.409 position:59% line:91%
Why are you giving me
the nutrition information for a duck?!

00:05:04.409 --> 00:05:05.808 line:85%
<c.yellow>What do we do now then?</c>

00:05:05.808 --> 00:05:07.691 line:91%
<c.yellow>What if he's just doing
a lap of London?</c>

00:05:07.691 --> 00:05:10.900 line:91%
Even with me being sceptical of
how good the AirTag is...

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:14.765 position:58% line:91%
Arun must have got a location.
He must know I'm in this area by now.

00:05:14.765 --> 00:05:17.018 line:85%
So... let's get a...

00:05:17.018 --> 00:05:18.493 line:85%
Let's feed a duck and get out.

00:05:18.493 --> 00:05:20.062 line:85%
That is a pigeon.

00:05:20.765 --> 00:05:22.853 line:91%
<c.yellow>My confidence levels are dropping.</c>
<c.yellow><i>(wheezes)</i></c>

00:05:22.853 --> 00:05:24.602 line:85%
That is a crow.

00:05:25.354 --> 00:05:26.452 line:85%
That's a goose.

00:05:26.452 --> 00:05:28.558 align:start size:94% position:6% line:91%
There's gotta be a duck
around here somewhere.

00:05:28.558 --> 00:05:31.293 align:start size:94% position:6% line:85%
<c.yellow>Tom is not updating. No.</c>

00:05:31.293 --> 00:05:33.921 align:start position:0% line:91%
<c.yellow>You know what he's done? He's probably
turned his phone on airplane mode.</c>

00:05:34.703 --> 00:05:37.506 position:70% line:85%
"Chocolate is toxic to livestock like ducks."

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.840 line:85%
Nnnngh, that looks like a shop!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.457 line:91%
That's a coot. Those are swans.
Those are geese.

00:05:43.457 --> 00:05:44.965 line:85%
Where are the ducks?!

00:05:44.965 --> 00:05:47.043 line:85%
Today on "I Identify Birds"(!)

00:05:47.043 --> 00:05:49.124 line:91%
<c.yellow>So the issue is, if Tom has
put his phone on airplane mode,</c>

00:05:49.124 --> 00:05:53.295 position:70% line:91%
<c.yellow>then we can't rely on the AirTag to
constantly ping his location from his iPhone.</c>

00:05:53.295 --> 00:05:56.866 line:91%
<c.yellow>So we've instead gotta wait for him
to pass other people with iPhones</c>

00:05:56.866 --> 00:05:58.890 line:91%
<c.yellow>for that AirTag to ping
the location off them.</c>

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:01.292 line:91%
<c.yellow>Let's just go towards the water
and hope he pops up.</c>

00:06:02.268 --> 00:06:03.375 line:85%
Yes, I got a receipt.

00:06:03.375 --> 00:06:05.232 line:91%
This is a business expense.
<c.cyan>(giggles)</c>

00:06:05.232 --> 00:06:07.433 line:91%
This is a business-expense
slice of carrot cake.

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:08.837 line:91%
Where are the ducks?
There are the ducks.

00:06:08.837 --> 00:06:10.363 line:85%
<c.yellow>Water's our best shot.</c>

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:12.720 line:85%
<c.yellow>We just gotta outrun him.</c>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.689 line:85%
Do I see Arun anywhere?

00:06:15.249 --> 00:06:17.143 line:85%
I don't— I don't see him.

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:19.879 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh, okay. It's updated.</c>

00:06:19.879 --> 00:06:21.936 line:92%
<c.yellow>Queen Victoria Memorial.</c>

00:06:21.936 --> 00:06:23.591 line:92%
<c.yellow>He's not far, he's not far!</c>

00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:26.029 line:85%
<c.yellow>Duck Island is where he is.</c>

00:06:26.029 --> 00:06:28.085 line:85%
<c.yellow>He's feeding the ducks, he is!</c>

00:06:28.085 --> 00:06:30.139 line:85%
Duck, duck.

00:06:30.139 --> 00:06:31.882 line:85%
Go on. That's a point.

00:06:32.409 --> 00:06:34.122 line:91%
<c.yellow>So it looks like
Tom's managed to sneak in</c>

00:06:34.122 --> 00:06:36.957 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>a cheeky little duck feeding session
on the way down.</c>

00:06:36.957 --> 00:06:39.661 line:91%
<c.yellow>But we're gonna cut him off
before he gets to the Thames.</c>

00:06:39.661 --> 00:06:41.724 line:91%
This way.
St. James Park station.

00:06:41.724 --> 00:06:44.088 line:91%
Also, do you want some carrot cake?
<c.cyan>I'd love some carrot cake.</c>

00:06:44.088 --> 00:06:44.921 line:85%
There we go.

00:06:44.921 --> 00:06:46.650 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, he's moving.
I can see him moving.</c>

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.651 line:91%
<c.cyan>That's pretty good carrot cake.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE><i>(muffled)</i> It's not bad.</c>

00:06:48.651 --> 00:06:51.281 position:70% line:85%
<c.yellow>Hi, can we go to Westminster station, please?</c>

00:06:51.281 --> 00:06:52.844 line:85%
What can we get around here?

00:06:52.844 --> 00:06:54.906 line:85%
I can't take the Tube again, so...

00:06:56.024 --> 00:06:58.940 line:91%
"Cross the Thames.
Visit a famous boat."

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.579 position:59% line:91%
There must be a tourist tat shop there
where I can get a stupid hat.

00:07:03.151 --> 00:07:05.884 line:91%
"Change one item of clothing."
Alright. South.

00:07:06.502 --> 00:07:08.449 line:85%
Oh, also parakeets.

00:07:11.636 --> 00:07:13.279 line:91%
<c.green>YouTube guy. I know you.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:07:13.279 --> 00:07:16.772 position:70% line:91%
Also in the middle of a chase game right now.
But... enjoy the parakeets!

00:07:16.772 --> 00:07:19.559 line:91%
<c.yellow>So three of these tasks involve
this river right here,</c>

00:07:19.559 --> 00:07:23.052 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>and we're basically guarding the waterway
to make sure he doesn't get these done.</c>

00:07:23.777 --> 00:07:27.570 line:91%
I just know there's gonna be...
somewhere in this video...

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:31.624 position:58% line:91%
there's gonna be just this...
devastating shot out of a cab window,

00:07:31.624 --> 00:07:33.605 line:85%
as he goes down past there.

00:07:33.605 --> 00:07:36.421 line:85%
I'm paranoid of every cab now.

00:07:37.029 --> 00:07:39.643 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, it's just updated again.
He's that way.</c>

00:07:42.739 --> 00:07:43.432 line:85%
Right.

00:07:43.932 --> 00:07:45.261 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh, he's updated.</c>

00:07:45.781 --> 00:07:48.301 line:85%
Strand? Apparently that's close!

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.140 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:51.535 line:85%
I don't see him. I don't see him.

00:07:51.535 --> 00:07:54.971 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, I think the world's smallest
police station is around here.</c>

00:07:54.971 --> 00:07:57.534 line:85%
I don't see him. I don't see him.

00:07:58.941 --> 00:08:00.634 line:85%
Point and run!

00:08:09.349 --> 00:08:10.345 line:85%
<c.yellow>Hmm.</c>

00:08:10.345 --> 00:08:11.220 line:85%
<c.yellow>Probably there.</c>

00:08:13.046 --> 00:08:14.887 line:85%
I still don't see him. Okay.

00:08:14.887 --> 00:08:17.123 line:91%
<c.yellow>Who said you can't cover
London on foot?</c>

00:08:17.839 --> 00:08:20.329 line:85%
Okay, there are two choices.

00:08:20.329 --> 00:08:23.788 line:91%
Wtih the time left, there's only
two, maybe three I can get.

00:08:24.343 --> 00:08:25.823 line:85%
"Cross the Thames."

00:08:26.688 --> 00:08:28.260 line:91%
"Recite a line of Shakespeare
at the Globe."

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.000 position:64% line:85%
That's down there, but that's a long way.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.358 position:69% line:91%
Or "buy a gift for Arun from Covent Garden."
That's a time-waster.

00:08:33.358 --> 00:08:36.279 line:91%
"Change one item of clothing."
So that's two in Covent Garden.

00:08:36.279 --> 00:08:39.324 position:63% line:85%
And then... cross the Thames from there.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:44.183 line:91%
Covent Garden.
It's right there. It's right there.

00:08:45.899 --> 00:08:48.453 line:91%
<c.yellow>I hate to say this, but I think
it may be time to run again.</c>

00:08:51.092 --> 00:08:52.766 line:85%
<i>(groans)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Traffic!</c>

00:08:55.907 --> 00:08:57.075 line:85%
Here we go.

00:09:01.489 --> 00:09:03.530 line:91%
<c.yellow>We're as close as we've been,
right now.</c>

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:05.787 position:61% line:85%
Alright, I need to buy a gift for Arun.

00:09:05.787 --> 00:09:07.806 position:67% line:85%
I need to get a bit of clothing for myself.

00:09:08.032 --> 00:09:10.381 position:58% line:91%
I should really go to the Apple Store
and get him an AirTag,

00:09:10.381 --> 00:09:11.877 line:91%
but I think he's already got
about ten of them.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.452 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay wait. This way.</c>

00:09:15.475 --> 00:09:16.467 line:91%
<c.green>Thank you very much.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Thank you.</c>

00:09:16.467 --> 00:09:18.110 line:91%
Is it possible to get a
printed receipt though, please?

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.545 line:91%
<c.green>Yes.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Thank you.</c>

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:23.293 line:91%
This is the team's new
production office,

00:09:23.293 --> 00:09:25.821 position:58% line:91%
where all the prep for all the videos
