00:09:57.137 --> 00:09:59.532
in either gloss or matte,
to fit your wall.

00:09:59.532 --> 00:10:01.841
For the office, we went for
the light map of London,

00:10:01.841 --> 00:10:04.118
which looks spectacular
printed up on metal like this,

00:10:04.118 --> 00:10:05.196 line:92%
and...

00:10:06.297 --> 00:10:08.532
this beautiful bit of art
