00:10:12.007 --> 00:10:14.124 position:58% line:92%
and a load of movies and video games.

00:10:14.124 --> 00:10:16.963
And I also got this print of
NASA's Grand Tour design

00:10:16.963 --> 00:10:18.597 line:92%
from the Jet Propulsion Laboratory.

00:10:18.597 --> 00:10:20.037 line:92%
But I'm taking this one home.

00:10:20.037 --> 00:10:22.648 position:56%
You can go to the link in the
