00:10:22.648 --> 00:10:25.505
and to see the Displates
that the team and I here recommend.

00:10:25.505 --> 00:10:27.334 line:92%
Right. Back to the show.

00:10:29.379 --> 00:10:31.071 line:85%
Right, okay. Got him a gift.

00:10:31.571 --> 00:10:33.909 line:85%
I am now terrified that he has...

00:10:33.909 --> 00:10:36.921 line:91%
while I was in there,
talking to the wonderfully chatty—

00:10:36.921 --> 00:10:39.010 line:91%
but unfortunately, that's not
what I really want at that moment—

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.498 line:91%
the unfortunately chatty
shop assistant—

00:10:41.498 --> 00:10:44.158 line:85%
that he ran by, got the photo,

00:10:44.158 --> 00:10:46.331 line:91%
and moved on,
and is now tracking me.

00:10:46.331 --> 00:10:49.191 line:91%
<c.yellow>We've gotta find him at least.
We gotta just see Tom Scott.</c>

00:10:49.691 --> 00:10:52.054 line:91%
<c.yellow>He's like a mirage at this point.
Come on, let's go.</c>

00:10:53.667 --> 00:10:55.174 position:56% line:85%
Where are all the tourist tat shops?

00:10:55.174 --> 00:10:56.687 line:85%
London Transport Museum.

00:10:57.793 --> 00:10:59.866 line:91%
If he's found me by now,
I'm done for.

00:11:03.105 --> 00:11:05.006 line:91%
Thank you,
and can I get a receipt please?

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.048 line:85%
Do I see him? Can I see him?

00:11:08.592 --> 00:11:11.827 line:91%
I don't see him anywhere.
I'm gonna sneak down this corner.

00:11:12.486 --> 00:11:13.739 line:85%
And...

00:11:14.516 --> 00:11:18.177 position:58% line:91%
On the assumption
he hasn't got eyes on me right now...

00:11:18.677 --> 00:11:20.656 position:56% line:85%
I hate this hat. But nevertheless...

00:11:20.656 --> 00:11:22.088 line:85%
that's, I think, a point.

00:11:22.088 --> 00:11:24.001 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh god. <i>(pants heavily)</i></c>

00:11:24.001 --> 00:11:25.696 line:85%
<c.yellow>My London geography's terrible.</c>

00:11:26.795 --> 00:11:28.692 position:63% line:85%
<c.yellow>If I'd known this, I would have revised!</c>

00:11:28.692 --> 00:11:30.331 line:91%
Am I going the wrong way?
I think I'm going the wrong way.

00:11:31.116 --> 00:11:32.544 line:85%
If Arun's smart...

00:11:33.472 --> 00:11:34.934 line:85%
and he's tracking me...

00:11:34.934 --> 00:11:36.230 line:85%
then he'll see me going south.

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:40.167 position:58% line:91%
There's only... only one
possible route I could be taking now.

00:11:40.167 --> 00:11:42.157 line:85%
I think... I think?

00:11:42.157 --> 00:11:44.778 position:64% line:91%
If I've missed a really obvious strategy,
it's gonna be really annoying.

00:11:45.278 --> 00:11:46.568 line:85%
<c.yellow>Look how close we are.</c>

00:11:48.384 --> 00:11:50.487 line:91%
<c.yellow>Come on, Tom. Come on.
Anywhere here.</c>

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.478 line:85%
<c.yellow>I just wanna see him at this point.</c>

00:11:53.362 --> 00:11:55.047 line:91%
Will it be quicker
to find a bus stop up there?

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:56.867 line:85%
There's the bus stop. Alright.

00:11:56.867 --> 00:11:58.576 line:85%
Bus stop, south.

00:11:58.576 --> 00:11:59.790 line:85%
That'll be...

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.294 line:85%
Should be... quicker overall...?

00:12:03.607 --> 00:12:05.271 line:85%
<c.yellow>I am watching you, Tom.</c>

00:12:06.602 --> 00:12:08.055 line:85%
<c.yellow>I'm ready.</c>

00:12:08.055 --> 00:12:10.119 line:85%
Any bus going to Waterloo?

00:12:10.119 --> 00:12:11.832 line:85%
Literally any bus from this stop.

00:12:13.239 --> 00:12:14.427 line:85%
No, hang on.

00:12:14.427 --> 00:12:18.001 line:91%
1, 188, 68, 168,
59, 243...

00:12:18.001 --> 00:12:19.414 line:85%
1, that bus'll do!

00:12:20.634 --> 00:12:23.179 line:91%
<c.yellow>Literally any person here
could be him.</c>

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.765 line:91%
<c.yellow>He's moved a little bit more.
Let's go, let's run.</c>

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.671 line:64%
<i>(sighs heavily)</i>

00:12:40.496 --> 00:12:41.657 line:64%
Oh, do you(?)

00:12:48.377 --> 00:12:50.898 line:91%
I'd like to think I've made
smart decisions in this game.

00:12:50.898 --> 00:12:53.406 line:91%
And I really...
I really don't think I have.

00:12:58.722 --> 00:13:01.394 line:85%
<c.yellow>No. Oh, wait.</c>

00:13:01.394 --> 00:13:02.579 line:85%
<c.yellow>Can't tell, is that him?</c>

00:13:02.579 --> 00:13:04.973 line:91%
This is a bad decision.
This was such a bad—

00:13:04.973 --> 00:13:07.422 line:85%
Every— Every other bus is going by.

00:13:07.422 --> 00:13:09.894 position:66% line:91%
I should've got off this one.
<c.yellow>We are literally one minute away from him.</c>

00:13:10.655 --> 00:13:13.173 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>Come on, we have eight minutes left.
We've got to do this.</c>

00:13:14.654 --> 00:13:16.656 line:91%
Okay. Okay, we're moving.
We're moving.

00:13:16.656 --> 00:13:18.972 line:85%
<c.yellow>We're almost on top of him.</c>

00:13:18.972 --> 00:13:21.585 line:64%
We should have playtested this.

00:13:21.585 --> 00:13:23.723 line:91%
<c.yellow>He was last seen here
four minutes ago.</c>

00:13:23.723 --> 00:13:25.885 line:91%
<c.yellow>Come on, give me something.
Give me something.</c>

00:13:25.885 --> 00:13:27.123 line:85%
Somewhere down here.

00:13:29.148 --> 00:13:30.907 line:85%
I don't see him.

00:13:30.907 --> 00:13:32.974 line:91%
I don't see him. I don't see him.
I don't see him.

00:13:32.974 --> 00:13:34.638 line:91%
I'm still wearing
this stupid hat, aren't I?

00:13:34.638 --> 00:13:36.445 line:85%
<c.yellow>Uhhh... I don't know!</c>

00:13:36.445 --> 00:13:37.982 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, let's assume river.
Let's go.</c>

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.067 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>Waterloo Bridge, South Bank.</i></c>

00:13:42.101 --> 00:13:43.873 line:85%
The Globe is...

00:13:45.197 --> 00:13:47.338 position:59% line:85%
hopefully seven minutes' run that way.

00:13:48.023 --> 00:13:48.791 line:85%
Here we go.

00:13:48.791 --> 00:13:50.897 line:85%
<c.yellow>Ah, he could be on a bus!</c>

00:13:57.116 --> 00:13:58.615 line:85%
There is not a way down here!

00:14:00.659 --> 00:14:02.424 position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>See, if he is actually sat on a bus,</c>

00:14:02.424 --> 00:14:05.304 line:91%
<c.yellow>and he's not near anyone
who has an Apple device,</c>

00:14:05.304 --> 00:14:06.389 line:85%
<c.yellow>we've got no chance.</c>

00:14:06.889 --> 00:14:08.761 line:91%
I'll see you at the Globe.
Or on the way there!

00:14:12.175 --> 00:14:13.071 line:85%
This was a bad plan!

00:14:14.307 --> 00:14:16.935 line:91%
This was a very bad plan.
I should've got a taxi!

00:14:18.459 --> 00:14:20.797 line:85%
You...<i><00:14:19.813><c> idiot!</c></i>

00:14:21.393 --> 00:14:24.358 line:91%
<c.yellow>Might as well spend my last minute
enjoying the sights of London.</c>

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:26.918 line:85%
From my side...

00:14:26.918 --> 00:14:28.567 line:85%
I've learned...

00:14:28.567 --> 00:14:31.507 line:91%
...that my planning
under pressure is awful!

00:14:31.507 --> 00:14:33.476 line:85%
Genuinely awful!

00:14:33.952 --> 00:14:35.952 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(chuckles)</i></c>

00:14:36.868 --> 00:14:39.122 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>What's it, like—
a million Apple devices in this city?</c>

00:14:39.122 --> 00:14:42.093 line:85%
And that... is time.

00:14:43.076 --> 00:14:44.125 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(alarm rings)</i></c>

00:14:44.779 --> 00:14:46.210 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh no, is that my gift?</c>

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.000 line:91%
Got you a gift.
<c.yellow>Oh no!</c>

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.170 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:51.391 line:91%
<c.yellow>I've never been so upset
to receive something.</c>

00:14:51.391 --> 00:14:53.312 line:85%
It was so close!

00:14:53.312 --> 00:14:55.694 line:91%
And... also...
<c.yellow>Thank you.</c>

00:14:55.694 --> 00:14:58.562 line:85%
In a change of pocket, an AirTag.

00:14:58.562 --> 00:14:59.487 line:85%
<c.yellow>Aww.</c>

00:14:59.487 --> 00:15:01.711 line:91%
Did you just guess
where I was going on the Tube?

00:15:01.711 --> 00:15:04.217 position:63% line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, we had to, because the whole time,
we were three minutes behind.</c>

00:15:04.217 --> 00:15:05.135 line:85%
Yeah.

00:15:05.135 --> 00:15:06.965 line:91%
<c.yellow>And because AirTags
don't give you direction,</c>

00:15:06.965 --> 00:15:09.559 line:91%
<c.yellow>we just kinda had to
use your rough—</c>

00:15:09.559 --> 00:15:12.000 position:70% line:91%
And you had to look at the list and work out,
"Okay, he's probably going to hit those."

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:12.969 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:15:12.969 --> 00:15:14.851 line:91%
Okay so, you could've
followed me home with it,

00:15:14.851 --> 00:15:18.491 position:64% line:91%
but you can't live-stalk someone with it.
<c.yellow>Exactly that. That's what I was thinking.</c>

00:15:18.491 --> 00:15:19.992 line:91%
<c.yellow>In theory,
it should be really accurate,</c>

00:15:19.992 --> 00:15:21.665 line:91%
<c.yellow>because there's, like,
a billion devices around the world.</c>

00:15:21.665 --> 00:15:22.402 line:85%
Yeah.

00:15:22.402 --> 00:15:24.726 line:91%
<c.yellow>But, I guess in practice,
when you're moving fast,</c>

00:15:24.726 --> 00:15:26.898 line:91%
<c.yellow>maybe it doesn't have the—</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Actively trying not to be found(!)</c>

00:15:26.898 --> 00:15:29.605 line:91%
With a load of walls, they're gonna
bounce GPS stuff off everything.

00:15:29.605 --> 00:15:30.674 line:91%
<c.yellow>That's also true.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:15:30.674 --> 00:15:32.316 line:91%
<c.yellow>I guess the other thing
I was thinking is...</c>

00:15:32.316 --> 00:15:35.138 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>This doesn't necessarily prove
that it's not a good tracking device,</c>

00:15:35.138 --> 00:15:37.775 line:91%
<c.yellow>because this time, you were aware
that I put one on you.</c>

00:15:37.775 --> 00:15:39.223 line:85%
Oh, if I wasn't—

00:15:39.223 --> 00:15:40.752 line:85%
The number of times I was going,

00:15:40.752 --> 00:15:42.392 line:91%
"Is he— Where— Run—
I'm going— No—

00:15:42.392 --> 00:15:44.102 line:91%
I'm by the wall here.
I'm gonna stay out of the way."

00:15:44.102 --> 00:15:46.569 line:85%
I was convinced multiple times

00:15:46.569 --> 00:15:49.392 line:91%
that you were just hiding
behind somewhere, ready.

00:15:49.392 --> 00:15:51.564 line:91%
I am looking forward to
seeing this back,

00:15:51.564 --> 00:15:54.679 line:91%
and seeing just how close you got.
<c.yellow>Yeah, me too.</c>

00:15:54.679 --> 00:15:56.518 line:68%
<c.yellow>This was great.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Thank you very much, man.</c>

00:15:56.518 --> 00:15:58.152 line:68%
<c.yellow>Alright, see ya.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE><i>(cackles)</i></c>

00:15:58.152 --> 00:16:00.609 line:68%
Don't wander off now.
We can go to the pub!

00:16:01.122 --> 00:16:02.286 line:64%
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i> Oh yeah.</c>

